'''''Sparrmannia''''' is a genus of [[flowering plant]]s in the family [[Malvaceae]]. It includes three species native to eastern, central, and southern Africa and Madagascar.<ref name = powo/>

==Species==
[[Plants of the World Online]] accepts three species.<ref name = powo/>
* ''[[Sparrmannia africana]]'' {{small|L.f.}}
* ''[[Sparrmannia palmata]]'' {{small|Baker}}
* ''[[Sparrmannia ricinocarpa]]'' {{small|(Eckl. & Zeyh.) Kuntze}}

